'''Takuya''' (タクヤ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Takuya
|image = E 158.png
|appearance = [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 660¢ - 2,607¢
}}

==Enemy==
This mid-ranged Traitless enemy has frequent, moderately damaging attacks, significant health and only two knockbacks. Already annoying alone, he becomes a dangerous support unit when at higher strength magnifications in the presence of ranged threats.

==Strategy==
Takuya can be difficult to deal with, as his high range can expose your other units and he certainly never goes down without a fight. Spammable attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and/or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] are able to whittle them down. Alternatively, Takuya can be abused by Wave/Surge/LD units to snipe threats behind without having to destroy him first.

